<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SWISS CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWISS CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinal matches in</p>
<p>the Swiss Cup on Monday:</p>
<p>Lucerne  2  Schaffhouse  1</p>
<p> Sion     5  Fribourg     2</p>
<p>Lucerne meet Sion in the final on June 8.</p>
</text>
